            {
               "name": "",
               "keys": [
                  "Zootopia",
                  "Zootropolis"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "Zootopia is a massive city home to millions of various anthropomorphic mammals. Only mammals inhabit Zootopia, not avians nor reptiles. It’s often referred to as a place of infinite possibility and is one of the richest cities in the world. However, it also has a high rate of crime, partly due to its understaffed police force. The city is split into several districts and has 12 distinct ecosystems separated by massive climate walls, designed to comfortably house mammals from all over the world. Though it’s a place where predators and prey can coexist, there is some existential speciesism between the two classes.",
