               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "Tundratown is one of Zootopia's districts, lying to the north-west of Savanna Central. It's very cold and blustery, and is home to many cold-weather mammals. It regularly snows here - even in summer. It has a large wall which separates the district from Sahara Square and helps keep its frigid climate secure. Tundratown is also home to a large organized-crime ring operated by the mysterious Mr. Big.",
